    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Fitzgerald Chambers are delighted to present this detached home with every amenity on your doorstep. The property was built in 2007 and is modernised throughout with great flair and attention to detail creating a stylish low maintenance home that's in truly walk in condition throughout. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation on the ground floor is open plan and comprises living room/dining room/kitchen and guest WC. Upstairs there is a double bedroom with an ensuite shower room and a large study with an ensuite shower room. To the front of the property there is a driveway and to the rear of this delightful property there is a large patio accessed through the kitchen.  There is also rear access from the side entrance.\r\n\r\nSituated just minutes from Cabra Village, Stoneybatter & Phibsborough Villages, the Cabra LUAS Green Line, and a variety of local shops, schools, and amenities, this property enjoys easy access to the City Centre, Phoenix Park, and TU Dublin Grangegorman campus.  Other public transport options include Bus routes on the nearby North Circular Road and Cabra Road.\r\n\r\nThis is a great opportunity to acquire a beautiful property in a highly convenient and well-established neighbourhood!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "LOUNGE AREA\r\nLocated to the front of the property with built in storage\r\n\r\nDINING AREA\r\nWith French doors that open to beautiful patio to rear.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN AREA\r\nWith tiled surround, ample eye and low-level units.\r\n\r\nGUEST WC\r\nWith WC and WHB.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\t\r\nBEDROOM \r\nDouble bedroom located to the front of the property with built in storage units.\r\n\r\nENSUITE\r\nWith WC, WHB and shower cubicle.\r\n\r\nSTUDY\r\nLarge room with built in storage units.\r\n\r\nENSUITE\r\nWith WC, WHB and shower cubicle.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nEXTERIOR\r\nDriveway to front, large patio to rear with side access."
      },
